OL,3,GNEWSAStormont in 'substantive
OL,4,Anegotiation' about budget with UK
OL,5,Agovernment
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Stormont executive is now in a
OL,8,F"substantive negotiation" with the
OL,9,Fgovernment on additional money to break
OL,10,Fthe budget deadlock, Finance Minister
OL,11,FJohn O'Dowd has said.
OL,13,FHe was speaking after ministers met the
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,15,FBryant on Friday morning as an
OL,16,Fincreased offer was made to the
OL,17,Fexecutive of #1.5bn over the next three
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
