OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStormont in 'substantive
OL,4,Anegotiation' about budget with UK
OL,5,Agovernment
OL,6,
OL,7,FO'Dowd said he did not believe that the
OL,8,Ftalks need to go on for "weeks", adding
OL,9,Fthat he and others had been pressing
OL,10,Fthe Treasury for months to come to the
OL,11,Ftable.
OL,13,FOn Monday, Sir Chris visited Stormont
OL,14,Fand made an initial offer of #350m per
OL,15,Fyear over the same period to help
OL,16,Fstabilise the executive's finances - a
OL,17,F#1.1bn package.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
